    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something very wrong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or did you just misremember things?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore the world of &quot;The Lap&quot; and see its idyllic sights and sounds through:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0--Over 50+ hand-drawn backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Take a journey through a strange land with some point-and-click elements, meeting a variety of\u00a0odd, object-headed citizens as you investigate:<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0--Accompanied by dozens of beautifully hand-animated character sprites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Let a bizarre mystery unfold as you help Marion find a way of keeping her entire world from slipping between her hands.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something very wrong. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or did you just misremember things?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Explore the world of &quot;The Lap&quot; and see its idyllic sights and sounds through:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0--Over 50+ hand-drawn backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Take a journey through a strange land with some point-and-click elements, meeting a variety of\u00a0odd, object-headed citizens as you investigate:<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0--Accompanied by dozens of beautifully hand-animated character sprites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Let a bizarre mystery unfold as you help Marion find a way of keeping her entire world from slipping between her hands.</p>",
    "short_description": "When the sun shines on the Lap of the Gods, it is blood red. And when it rains, the sky sobs. Explore a strange world populated by even stranger beings in this story-driven adventure as Marion attempts to undo a mistake on a universal level, before everything she has ever known becomes Undone.",
